{
  "brief_rationale": "The trajectory repeatedly screened evolving cardiopulmonary symptoms, gave clear escalation instructions, reconciled incomplete records, and established cardiology follow-up and medication verification. However, it made an overconfident no-stent inference from incomplete documentation and then terminated without answering the family's actionable question about a missed ticagrelor dose or completing the requested home medication plan. These minor/moderate responsibility-chain and execution errors cap the grade at 2 despite substantial later planning and family engagement.",
