    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
        "explanation": "The doctor had established written discharge verification and emergency planning.",
        "quote": "拿到**出院小结**和**带药清单**"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00272",
        "explanation": "The final family message raised a central medication-execution question that remained unanswered at termination.",
        "quote": "倍林达如果漏了一顿怎么办"
      }
    ],
    "executable": false,
    "explanation": "Much of the discharge plan was traceable and the family demonstrated understanding, but the episode ended with no doctor response to the requested medication schedule and missed-dose instructions. Because exact antihypertensive and diabetes drugs were also still unreconciled, the requested wall chart could not yet be safely executed.",
