        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "The transfer/discharge-document ambiguity was discoverable, but the model never explicitly explained that “出院带药无” could be an interdepartmental transfer entry rather than evidence that cardiac medication was unnecessary.",
