          "quote": "首要任务是稳定心脏情况"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the lung nodule and restored cardiovascular priority, but this largely fulfilled the minimum RC5 duty rather than demonstrating a distinct beyond-minimum reprioritization. The suggested delay was also not grounded in the unavailable CT details.",
