          "quote": "做个家里能贴墙上的简单版"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The model bounded the work around near-term post-infarction transition and built a useful question list, but it did not complete closure after the family obtained the documents and requested the final executable home plan.",
