          "event_id": "lite_evt_00255",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided an actionable pre-discharge checklist and requested written materials.",
          "quote": "办理出院手续前完成"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00272",
          "explanation": "The family gave a detailed receipt but requested final home medication and monitoring instructions that were never answered.",
          "quote": "早上吃什么、晚上吃什么"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The family demonstrated substantial understanding and completed many assigned tasks, but the model did not respond after the final teach-back and request for the executable home plan. Closure therefore remained incomplete rather than safely completed.",
